  "description": "Bespoke Estate Agents are delighted to offer this fantastic ocean front property to the rental market. The apartment is located on the second floor and enjoys uninterrupted sea views looking onto Bull Island, Howth Head and Sutton. The area benefits from a huge host of amenities on its doorstep with a selection of local shows and supermarkets, quick access to the M50 and Dublin City Centre (Approx. 20 mins driving), The DART at Bayside is just a short walk, Bull Island which is a Unesco heritage site, St. Annes Park, beautiful restaurants in Howth, Malahide & Portmarnock. Stunning coastal and cliff walks, bicycle lane directly into Dublin City and much more.\n\nThe property briefly comprises: entrance hall with large storage press, extra large living room with feature fireplace, generous dining area and direct access to the winter garden with uninterrupted sea views, large kitchen with sea views, dishwasher, large fridge/ freezer, 2 generous double bedrooms with large built in wardrobes, modern bathroom.\n\nOutside there is 1 parking space behind secure electric gates and bins included.\n\n",
